{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12f75faa", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:01:00", "text": "Absolutely, George. We should expand our API support to include more third-party data sources. This means revising the 'Integration Capabilities' section to highlight our commitment to flexibility and adaptability. We should also consider partnerships with key data providers to enhance our integration options. @eid_bd791efc, any input on prediction accuracy?", "utterranceID": "20260407-4-b6b2e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260407-4-b6b2e"}
