{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T16:09:00", "text": "Same here. Appreciate the update and the fix!", "utterranceID": "20260907-8-6c369"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-8-6c369"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:32:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data normalization has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/TrendForce/pull/32.", "utterranceID": "20260907-0-50333"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-0-50333"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:34:00", "text": "To recap, the issue was with the data preprocessing module. It was improperly scaling datasets with varying units, which led to inconsistent trend analysis results.", "utterranceID": "20260907-1-def2a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-1-def2a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:38:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Charlie! What was the root cause of the improper scaling?", "utterranceID": "20260907-2-12a13"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-2-12a13"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:42:00", "text": "Good question, @eid_92c62291. The root cause was a mismatch in the unit conversion logic. The algorithm assumed all data sources had the same unit, which wasn't the case.", "utterranceID": "20260907-3-e614f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-3-e614f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:47:00", "text": "How did you manage to fix it, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20260907-4-c49e8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-4-c49e8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:49:00", "text": "I updated the preprocessing module to dynamically detect and adjust for different units before normalization. This ensures consistent scaling across all datasets.", "utterranceID": "20260907-5-2ad27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-5-2ad27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:52:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! This should improve our trend analysis accuracy significantly.", "utterranceID": "20260907-6-b571f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-6-b571f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:56:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. I'll be monitoring the results closely.", "utterranceID": "20260907-7-fd006"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-7-fd006"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:57:00", "text": "Thanks again, Charlie. I'll run some tests on my end to verify the fix.", "utterranceID": "20260907-8-d9e2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-8-d9e2c"}
