{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2026-04-12T18:14:00", "text": "Absolutely! Lastly, we have Elasticsearch: Improved Query Result Caching. This PR enhances caching for query results to speed up search operations. Check it out here: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/3540. Any thoughts, team?", "utterranceID": "20260412-7-0c6f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-7-0c6f7"}
