{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-be8ae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_18571957", "timestamp": "2027-01-23T19:18:00", "text": "GIMP's approach to layer management is quite relevant. It emphasizes accessibility, which is a key aspect for us too. We should look into how they map their shortcuts. @eid_136119e9, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270123-6-c87aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-6-c87aa"}
