{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T23:07:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Data Fragmentation from Frequent Updates'. The AI assistant's frequent updates to database records are causing data fragmentation, which is degrading system performance. This affects Database Management and is impacting customer CUST-0107. @eid_b9189afb, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-62f7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-62f7c"}
