{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T14:07:00", "text": "@eid_89afe48f joined planning-castAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260401-66-c6f08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-66-c6f08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f86a00ce", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T22:57:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for castAIX is the lack of customization options for forecast models. This was highlighted by Customer ID: CUST-0065.", "utterranceID": "20260419-0-23fdb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-0-23fdb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T22:59:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Fiona. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their design choices.", "utterranceID": "20260419-1-0ec7a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-1-0ec7a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_69067a7c", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T23:02:00", "text": "Agreed, George. It sounds like the model architecture might be too rigid, not allowing for user modifications.", "utterranceID": "20260419-2-ff78a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-2-ff78a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T23:07:00", "text": "That's a good point, Hannah. We should also consider if there's limited support for custom model parameters and configurations.", "utterranceID": "20260419-3-63c10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-3-63c10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7871ba4e", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T23:09:00", "text": "Right, David. It could be that the focus was on creating generic solutions rather than tailored, business-specific models.", "utterranceID": "20260419-4-47f9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-4-47f9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_89afe48f", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T23:11:00", "text": "Emma here. Maybe the previous team didn't anticipate the need for more adaptable models. We should definitely look into this.", "utterranceID": "20260419-5-ab590"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-5-ab590"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f86a00ce", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T23:13:00", "text": "@eid_89afe48f, I agree. We need to ensure our next release addresses these customization needs.", "utterranceID": "20260419-6-ef53b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-6-ef53b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T23:15:00", "text": "Let's make sure these customer issues are documented in our planning documents for the next release of castAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260419-7-7dd56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-7-7dd56"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T00:30:00", "text": "@eid_d508e9fb joined planning-castAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260403-75-e1180"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-75-e1180"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T12:07:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for castAIX is occasional inaccuracies in predictions when dealing with highly volatile data. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0099.", "utterranceID": "20260404-0-281d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-0-281d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d508e9fb", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T12:08:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the forecasting algorithms used.", "utterranceID": "20260404-1-7173f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-1-7173f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12f75faa", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T12:12:00", "text": "Good point, Bob. It could be that the algorithms aren't handling data volatility well enough. We should check if they have any mechanisms for that.", "utterranceID": "20260404-2-dace9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-2-dace9"}

