{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:37:00", "text": "Hi team, I hope you're all doing well! 😊 I wanted to kick off a discussion about our proposed PR to enhance the UI/UX of our Analytics Dashboard. To guide our implementation, I've found some similar features from open-source projects that we can learn from. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260715-0-6db4a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-0-6db4a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:42:00", "text": "First up, we have the 'Responsive Notebook Layout' from JupyterLab. This PR enhances the notebook interface to be fully responsive and adaptable to different screen sizes. You can check it out here: https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/3322. What do you all think? @eid_d0d918f1", "utterranceID": "20260715-1-d1b5b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-1-d1b5b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:43:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! This JupyterLab feature is pretty impressive. Making the notebook interface responsive is crucial for users who switch between devices. I think we can definitely draw some inspiration from their approach to responsiveness. 📱💻", "utterranceID": "20260715-2-c2803"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-2-c2803"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:46:00", "text": "I agree with Charlie. The way JupyterLab handles responsiveness could be really beneficial for our dashboard. It might be worth looking into how they manage layout changes dynamically. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260715-3-818cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-3-818cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:47:00", "text": "Great points, Charlie and Ian! Next, let's look at Mattermost's 'Intuitive Channel Navigation'. This PR improves the channel navigation UI for a more intuitive and seamless user experience across devices. Here's the link: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-server/pull/3323. Thoughts? @eid_8605f7ee", "utterranceID": "20260715-4-c71db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-4-c71db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:48:00", "text": "The Mattermost feature is interesting. Simplifying navigation is always a win for user experience. We should consider how they streamline access to different sections, which could be useful for our dashboard's navigation. 🧭", "utterranceID": "20260715-5-4f826"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-5-4f826"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:51:00", "text": "Julia makes a good point. Intuitive navigation can significantly reduce user frustration. We should definitely explore how Mattermost achieves this seamless experience. 👌", "utterranceID": "20260715-6-42e0d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-6-42e0d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:53:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia and Ian! Lastly, we have Nextcloud's 'Adaptive File Management UI'. This PR refines the file management interface to ensure responsiveness and ease of use on various devices. Check it out here: https://github.com/nextcloud/server/pull/3324. What do you think, team?", "utterranceID": "20260715-7-9ca51"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-7-9ca51"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:56:00", "text": "Nextcloud's approach to adaptive UI is quite relevant. Ensuring ease of use across devices is something we should aim for. Their focus on file management could translate well to how we handle data visualization in our dashboard. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260715-8-70fc7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-8-70fc7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T00:01:00", "text": "I agree with Charlie. The adaptability of Nextcloud's UI is something we should consider. It might be worth looking into their techniques for maintaining functionality across different screen sizes. 📐", "utterranceID": "20260715-9-983cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-9-983cd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T00:04:00", "text": "Thanks for the insights, everyone! It sounds like there's a lot we can learn from these projects. I'll take the lead on investigating these features further and see how we can adapt some of their strategies for our dashboard. Let's aim to make our UI/UX as intuitive and responsive as possible! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260715-10-f0378"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-10-f0378"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-18T01:27:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for the Analytics Dashboard UI/UX enhancements: https://github.com/salesforce/FForceAIX/pull/16. I've focused on making the design more intuitive and responsive across all devices. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260720-0-15e98"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260720-0-15e98"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-18T01:30:00", "text": "@eid_ba9224d2 Thanks for sharing, I'll take a look now! 👀", "utterranceID": "20260720-1-3cfb2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260720-1-3cfb2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-07-18T01:35:00", "text": "Hey @eid_ba9224d2, just went through the PR. The design looks consistent with our product guidelines. Great job on maintaining the style! 🎨", "utterranceID": "20260720-2-601c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260720-2-601c6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T01:21:00", "text": "Hi team, 👋 I wanted to kick off a discussion about our new PR for role-based access control on dashboard customization. I've found some similar features in open-source projects that might give us some insights. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261015-0-4207a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-0-4207a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T01:25:00", "text": "First up, Grafana has a feature called Role-Based Panel Access Control. It ensures users can only view and edit panels they have permissions for. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/4930. What do you guys think? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261015-1-4f7af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-1-4f7af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T01:26:00", "text": "Hey David T., that sounds pretty aligned with what we're trying to do. Grafana's approach to panel-specific permissions could be really useful for us. It might help us refine our granularity in access control. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261015-2-f873a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-2-f873a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df7ae03e", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T01:28:00", "text": "Agreed, George. Grafana's implementation could definitely inform our strategy. I like how they focus on both viewing and editing permissions. We should consider something similar. @eid_70223d0a, maybe you could look into how they handle permission inheritance?", "utterranceID": "20261015-3-7f041"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-3-7f041"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId"

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_719a0253", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:22:00", "text": "Hi team, I've shared the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/knowledgeforce_technical_specifications_document|Technical Specifications Document> for KnowledgeForce. Let's discuss any feedback or suggestions you might have. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260617-0-0e8cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-0-0e8cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_52681a26", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:26:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! @eid_719a0253. I noticed in the System Architecture section, you mention using BERT and GPT for NLP tasks. Could we specify which versions we're using? This might help clarify the capabilities we're leveraging.", "utterranceID": "20260617-1-19ef1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-1-19ef1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_97b4acd0", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:29:00", "text": "Good point, Fiona. Also, in the Data Privacy and Security section, could we elaborate more on the role-based access controls? Maybe provide examples of roles and their access levels? This could help in understanding our security measures better.", "utterranceID": "20260617-2-91b49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-2-91b49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2c384d22", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:34:00", "text": "I agree with Julia. Additionally, in the Integration and Interfaces section, it might be beneficial to list some of the CRM systems and databases we support for data ingestion. This could give potential clients a clearer picture of compatibility.", "utterranceID": "20260617-3-4a32b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-3-4a32b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:35:00", "text": "Hey @eid_719a0253, I think the Competitive Analysis section could use a bit more depth. Maybe we could add a table comparing key features with IBM Watson and Microsoft Azure Cognitive Services? This could highlight our strengths more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260617-4-b2e68"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-4-b2e68"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9937f1d5", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:37:00", "text": "I like that idea, Julia. Also, in the Strategic Initiatives and Future Developments section, could we add a timeline for the blockchain integration and self-service analytics module? It would be great to set some expectations there.", "utterranceID": "20260617-5-523dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-5-523dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_072d9c10", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:42:00", "text": "I noticed that the User Interface and Experience section mentions customizable dashboards. Could we include a screenshot or a mock-up? Visuals might help convey the design and functionality better.", "utterranceID": "20260617-6-b9a15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-6-b9a15"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_719a0253", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:44:00", "text": "Thanks for all the feedback, everyone! 😊 To summarize: \n- Specify versions of BERT and GPT in System Architecture.\n- Elaborate on role-based access controls with examples.\n- List supported CRM systems and databases.\n- Add a comparison table in Competitive Analysis.\n- Include a timeline for future developments.\n- Consider adding visuals for the UI section.\n\nI'll make these updates and share a revised draft soon. Any other thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260617-7-7b669"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-7-7b669"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-geaix-c41fb2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T23:46:00", "text": "That sounds great, Hannah. Just one more thing, in the Machine Learning and Algorithms section, could we mention any plans for continuous model updates or improvements? It might be reassuring for clients to know we're committed to keeping our models up-to-date.", "utterranceID": "20260617-8-4bb9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-8-4bb9c"}

