{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e0273792", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T06:55:00", "text": "Lastly, there's an 'XSS Vulnerability in Comment Section' in WordPress. This is similar to our XSS issue in the Recommendation Engine. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/903. Hannah, this might be relevant for your work.", "utterranceID": "20260924-5-38980"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-5-38980"}
