{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:16:00", "text": "On it! Thanks for coordinating, Charlie! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260822-9-04cea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-9-04cea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:30:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Connection Pool Exhaustion' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/37.", "utterranceID": "20260825-0-debe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-0-debe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:34:00", "text": "The root cause was an insufficient connection pool size and a lack of connection reuse strategies, which led to the pool being exhausted under high load conditions.", "utterranceID": "20260825-1-77418"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-1-77418"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:25:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_b67edbb4. I adjusted the input field's maxLength attribute to match the backend's expected input size. Additionally, I added a validation check to ensure any future changes to the backend won't cause a similar issue.", "utterranceID": "20261113-3-ce625"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-3-ce625"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:29:00", "text": "Thanks, David! That sounds like a solid fix. I'll make sure to update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20261113-4-f522f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-4-f522f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:34:00", "text": "Thanks, David Miller. Let me know if there's anything else needed from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261113-5-ed083"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-5-ed083"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T10:39:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Feedback Transaction Log Overflow' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/35.", "utterranceID": "20261116-0-56d3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261116-0-56d3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T10:40:00", "text": "The issue was caused by inadequate log management and archiving strategies for high-volume feedback transactions. This led to excessive logging, causing the transaction log to overflow and resulting in slow database operations and increased latency.", "utterranceID": "20261116-1-c7627"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261116-1-c7627"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T10:41:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_e81cfe3f! What changes did you make to fix the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261116-2-83471"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261116-2-83471"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T10:44:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented a more efficient log rotation and archiving strategy. This includes setting up a threshold for log size and automatically archiving older logs to prevent overflow. Additionally, I optimized the logging level to reduce unnecessary entries.", "utterranceID": "20261116-3-a6822"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261116-3-a6822"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T10:49:00", "text": "Great work, David Martinez! That should help in maintaining the performance of our database operations. Let me know if there's anything else we need to monitor.", "utterranceID": "20261116-4-95652"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261116-4-95652"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T10:54:00", "text": "Thanks, David Miller! I'll keep an eye on the logs for the next few days to ensure everything is running smoothly. I'll update the team if anything comes up.", "utterranceID": "20261116-5-d7579"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261116-5-d7579"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T10:58:00", "text": "Sounds good, @eid_e81cfe3f. Appreciate your effort in getting this resolved quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261116-6-5e55a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261116-6-5e55a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:12:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Feedback Confirmation Message Not Displayed'.", "utterranceID": "20261117-0-785f3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-0-785f3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:17:00", "text": "The concern was that after users submit feedback, they don't see a confirmation message, which could lead to uncertainty about whether their feedback was received.", "utterranceID": "20261117-1-87d7a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-1-87d7a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:18:00", "text": "Upon reviewing the code, I found that there's a missing callback function in the feedback submission process that fails to trigger the display of a confirmation message.", "utterranceID": "20261117-2-bc9a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-2-bc9a4"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_072d9c10", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T01:36:00", "text": "Could you elaborate on why a fix isn't necessary, Alice?", "utterranceID": "20270302-3-dbf48"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-3-dbf48"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b95a6f0", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T01:39:00", "text": "Sure, George. The timeout error is actually an expected behavior under certain network conditions. The system is designed to handle large data sets, and occasional timeouts are anticipated when network latency is high.", "utterranceID": "20270302-4-e6660"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-4-e6660"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2471d598", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T01:41:00", "text": "So, it's more of a network issue rather than a system bug?", "utterranceID": "20270302-5-9295c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-5-9295c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b95a6f0", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T01:46:00", "text": "Exactly, Julia. The sync process is configured to retry automatically, ensuring eventual consistency. Users might see partial updates temporarily, but the system corrects itself without manual intervention.", "utterranceID": "20270302-6-cccb8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-6-cccb8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T01:50:00", "text": "Did you take any specific actions to verify this, Alice?", "utterranceID": "20270302-7-b102e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-7-b102e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b95a6f0", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T01:55:00", "text": "Yes, David. I ran several tests simulating high latency conditions and confirmed that the system eventually completes the sync without any data loss. I also reviewed the logs to ensure the retry mechanism is functioning as expected.", "utterranceID": "20270302-8-cfe4d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-8-cfe4d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_072d9c10", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T01:59:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, Alice. It's good to know the system is handling it as designed.", "utterranceID": "20270302-9-83140"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-9-83140"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2471d598", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T02:03:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks for looking into this, Alice!", "utterranceID": "20270302-10-f6000"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-10-f6000"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T02:07:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice. I'll update the ticket to reflect this information.", "utterranceID": "20270302-11-ce000"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-11-ce000"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:09:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Duplicate Data Entries' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/KnowledgeForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20270305-0-d51c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-0-d51c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_072d9c10", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:12:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_cdd331bc! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270305-1-5eaaf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-1-5eaaf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:15:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was a flaw in the deduplication logic within our data integration process. It wasn't correctly identifying and merging identical records, leading to multiple identical entries in the knowledge base.", "utterranceID": "20270305-2-c9f24"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-2-c9f24"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2471d598", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270305-3-a8ad5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-3-a8ad5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:23:00", "text": "I updated the deduplication algorithm to include a more comprehensive comparison of record attributes. This ensures that all relevant fields are checked before a new entry is created, effectively preventing duplicates.", "utterranceID": "20270305-4-138a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-4-138a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b95a6f0", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:24:00", "text": "Nice work, David! This should definitely help reduce confusion for our users.", "utterranceID": "20270305-5-4c849"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-5-4c849"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:29:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! If anyone notices any further issues, please let me know. Otherwise, we should be good to go.", "utterranceID": "20270305-6-b05b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-6-b05b9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:22:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! This is definitely relevant. The approach they took to optimize index usage could be insightful for our database management system. I'll dive into their solution and see how we can apply it. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261109-2-92f42"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-2-92f42"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:25:00", "text": "Great, Julia! Next, there's a Kubernetes issue titled 'API Rate Limiting Misconfiguration'. It describes excessive rate limiting on the API server, causing delays in pod scaling operations. Here's the PR: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/176. Ian, this sounds a lot like our API rate limiting problem. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261109-3-f74c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-3-f74c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:29:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma! The Kubernetes team's approach to adjusting rate limits could help us refine our own settings. I'll review their changes and see how we can adapt them for our backend server. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261109-4-48c0f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-4-48c0f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:33:00", "text": "Awesome, Ian! Lastly, there's an OAuth2 Proxy issue titled 'OAuth Token Validation Flaw'. It involves a misconfiguration in token validation that allows unauthorized access to protected resources. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/177. Fiona, this seems directly related to our OAuth misimplementation. Any insights?", "utterranceID": "20261109-5-91ea1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-5-91ea1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! This is spot on. The way they addressed token validation flaws could be crucial for us. I'll analyze their fix and ensure our OAuth implementation is secure. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261109-6-06cb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-6-06cb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:41:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work through our issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any more resources or support. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261109-7-12546"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-7-12546"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:43:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for bringing these to our attention, Emma. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261109-8-1b3ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-8-1b3ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:45:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's leverage these insights to enhance our solutions. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261109-9-f10fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-9-f10fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:48:00", "text": "On it! Appreciate the guidance, Emma. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261109-10-fd917"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-10-fd917"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T03:55:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Data Fragmentation Issues' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/44.", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-44007"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-44007"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:00:00", "text": "The root cause was frequent updates and deletions in our database tables without regular defragmentation, which led to fragmented data storage and increased I/O operations.", "utterranceID": "20261113-1-20be0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-1-20be0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:01:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a scheduled defragmentation process that runs during off-peak hours. This should help maintain optimal data retrieval speeds by reducing fragmentation.", "utterranceID": "20261113-2-05847"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-2-05847"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:19:00", "text": "However, after discussing with the product team and checking the design specs, it turns out that this is actually the expected behavior.", "utterranceID": "20261117-3-fcf10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-3-fcf10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:21:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David Martinez. Can you clarify why this is the expected behavior?", "utterranceID": "20261117-4-e8a26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-4-e8a26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:24:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_b67edbb4. The design decision was made to keep the feedback submission process minimal and non-intrusive. Users are redirected to the main page after submission, which serves as an implicit confirmation.", "utterranceID": "20261117-5-33c45"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-5-33c45"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:29:00", "text": "Got it, that makes sense. So no action is needed on our part?", "utterranceID": "20261117-6-92fc7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-6-92fc7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:30:00", "text": "Correct, David Miller. No code changes are necessary. I've documented this in our bug tracking system for future reference.", "utterranceID": "20261117-7-2b147"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-7-2b147"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:33:00", "text": "Thanks for the thorough investigation, David Martinez. I'll update the team accordingly.", "utterranceID": "20261117-8-b2a08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-8-b2a08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T03:38:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with FeedbackForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261119-0-e3b08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-0-e3b08"}
