{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T17:25:00", "text": "The issue was due to a JavaScript error in the front-end code that was interrupting the rendering process of certain UI components like charts and graphs.", "utterranceID": "20261207-1-0db84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-1-0db84"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T17:27:00", "text": "I have fixed it by updating the rendering logic to handle asynchronous data loading more gracefully. This ensures that all components are rendered correctly even if data is delayed.", "utterranceID": "20261207-2-6db91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-2-6db91"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T17:30:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/KnowledgeForce/pull/38", "utterranceID": "20261207-3-3e056"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-3-3e056"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88c661bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T17:35:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_ecaa9084! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20261207-4-c5b26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-4-c5b26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T17:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This should improve the user experience significantly. I'll make sure to test it out on the staging environment.", "utterranceID": "20261207-5-cc8e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-5-cc8e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T17:40:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_88c661bc and Julia. Let me know if you encounter any more issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261207-6-d9767"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-6-d9767"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88c661bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T17:41:00", "text": "Will do. Thanks again, Julia!", "utterranceID": "20261207-7-abe83"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-7-abe83"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T02:31:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Model Drift' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/KnowledgeForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20261208-0-0c1c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261208-0-0c1c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88c661bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T02:35:00", "text": "That's great news, @eid_ecaa9084! Could you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261208-1-52371"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261208-1-52371"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T02:39:00", "text": "Sure, Emma. The root cause was that our AI model wasn't being regularly updated or retrained to account for shifts in the data patterns. This led to a degradation in performance over time, as the model couldn't adapt to the changes in the underlying data distribution.", "utterranceID": "20261208-2-a74ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261208-2-a74ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T02:43:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, Julia. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261208-3-9ea7d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261208-3-9ea7d"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_619c8be2", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:45:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Memory Leak in Data Visualization Module' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AnomalyForce/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20261021-0-928b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-0-928b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_619c8be2", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:49:00", "text": "The root cause was improper management of dynamic data objects. They weren't being released after use, which led to excessive memory consumption and eventually caused the application to slow down and crash.", "utterranceID": "20261021-1-b0872"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-1-b0872"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_619c8be2", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:51:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a cleanup routine that ensures all dynamic data objects are properly released once they're no longer needed. This should prevent the memory from being consumed unnecessarily.", "utterranceID": "20261021-2-00111"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-2-00111"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a88ee967", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:52:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_619c8be2! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll make sure to test it thoroughly.", "utterranceID": "20261021-3-ce7c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-3-ce7c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_737797e3", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:56:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah Johnson! This was a critical issue. I'll update the documentation to reflect the changes.", "utterranceID": "20261021-4-c6036"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-4-c6036"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1330d187", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:58:00", "text": "Awesome job, @eid_619c8be2! Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261021-5-768af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-5-768af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_619c8be2", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T15:00:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_737797e3, updating the documentation sounds great. @eid_1330d187, I'll reach out if I need any help. Appreciate the support!", "utterranceID": "20261021-6-40445"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-6-40445"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1330d187", "timestamp": "2026-11-08T06:50:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with AnomalyForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261107-0-d8a78"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261107-0-d8a78"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1330d187", "timestamp": "2026-11-08T06:52:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Suboptimal Indexing Strategy' issue. The indexes aren't being properly utilized, causing slow query execution times in the Database Performance area. This is impacting CUST-0059, and it's critical since users are experiencing delays in receiving anomaly detection results. @eid_ec70ac57, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261107-1-70366"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261107-1-70366"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ec70ac57", "timestamp": "2026-11-08T06:55:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the indexing strategy and see how we can optimize it to improve performance. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261107-2-f37af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261107-2-f37af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1330d187", "timestamp": "2026-11-08T06:56:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an issue with 'Inaccurate Anomaly Detection in Sparse Datasets'. The algorithm isn't accurately identifying outliers, leading to false positives or missed anomalies. This affects the Anomaly Detection Algorithm area and impacts CUST-0058. @eid_737797e3, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261107-3-443f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261107-3-443f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_737797e3", "timestamp": "2026-11-08T07:00:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll review the algorithm and see how we can improve its accuracy with sparse datasets. We definitely want to maintain trust in our system. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261107-4-32b29"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261107-4-32b29"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a normalization step that ensures all user feedback is weighted equally, regardless of how frequently they provide input. This should help maintain a balanced dataset and improve model accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20261005-2-5ef82"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-2-5ef82"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:39:00", "text": "Great work, Alice! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The normalization step sounds like a solid solution.", "utterranceID": "20261005-3-e5f35"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-3-e5f35"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:44:00", "text": "@eid_54905dcb Thanks, Alice! This should definitely help with the model's performance. I'll run some tests to verify the improvements.", "utterranceID": "20261005-4-6c532"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-4-6c532"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:46:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and Hannah! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261005-5-b2821"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-5-b2821"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:51:00", "text": "Will do, Alice. I'll keep you posted on the test results.", "utterranceID": "20261005-6-c5e36"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-6-c5e36"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:42:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Feedback Data Redundancy Causing Bloat' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/30.", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-40caa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-40caa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:43:00", "text": "The root cause was due to a lack of normalization and deduplication processes in the database schema design. This led to redundant storage of feedback data, causing database bloat and slowing down data retrieval and processing times.", "utterranceID": "20261008-1-b1487"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-1-b1487"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:45:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a deduplication script that runs nightly to clean up redundant entries. Additionally, I updated the database schema to enforce normalization rules, ensuring that new data entries are stored efficiently. @eid_b6a30126, could you please verify the changes on your end?", "utterranceID": "20261008-2-bca92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-2-bca92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:47:00", "text": "Great work, Hannah! I'll check the changes and run some tests to ensure everything is working smoothly. Thanks for the quick turnaround.", "utterranceID": "20261008-3-68a2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-3-68a2c"}
