{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:06:00", "text": "Hey team! 👋 We've got a few customer-reported issues that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one.", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-329f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-329f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:08:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Feature Drift Causes Inconsistent Scoring'. The AI Scoring Algorithm isn't reflecting changes in lead behavior over time, leading to inconsistent and outdated lead scores. This is impacting CUST-0020, and it could mean missed opportunities or wasted resources on low-quality leads. @eid_9f4e2c6f, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260911-1-3feb6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-1-3feb6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:13:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the AI Scoring Algorithm and see what's causing the drift. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260911-2-33b1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-2-33b1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:16:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Misconfigured Export Permissions' issue. Users are able to export more data than they're authorized to, which could lead to data breaches. This is affecting CUST-0069. @eid_9f4e2c6f, you're on this one too.", "utterranceID": "20260911-3-1276e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-3-1276e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:19:00", "text": "Understood. I'll check the Data Export Module and fix the permissions. We definitely don't want any data breaches! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260911-4-7aaca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-4-7aaca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:23:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Lastly, we have an 'Improper Access Control in Export API' issue. Unauthorized users can access and export lead data, which is a big no-no. This is impacting CUST-0037. @eid_3f4b2681, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260911-5-ae35b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-5-ae35b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:25:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll look into the access control mechanisms in the Export API and tighten things up. Thanks for assigning it to me! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20260911-6-9917e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-6-9917e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:26:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260911-7-c75b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-7-c75b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:29:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_99835861! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260911-8-5a937"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-8-5a937"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:33:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_99835861! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260911-9-80937"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-9-80937"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T10:45:00", "text": "Hi team! 👋 Let's take a look at some similar issues from open-source projects that might give us insights into our current bugs. First up, we have a bug from TensorFlow.", "utterranceID": "20260914-0-fe8e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-0-fe8e6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_eed289d3", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T04:03:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_83b716d4. The root cause was imbalanced or biased training data, which led to a model that reflected these biases. This affected the diversity and relevance of the recommendations.", "utterranceID": "20261130-2-00b7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-2-00b7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e0273792", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T04:06:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Charlie. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261130-3-396b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-3-396b8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_eed289d3", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T04:07:00", "text": "To address the issue, we implemented a data augmentation strategy to balance the training dataset. Additionally, we incorporated fairness constraints during the model training process to ensure more equitable recommendations. This should help mitigate the bias and improve the model's performance.", "utterranceID": "20261130-4-18fdc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-4-18fdc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_83b716d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T04:09:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid approach. Thanks for handling this, Charlie!", "utterranceID": "20261130-5-9f025"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-5-9f025"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e0273792", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T04:12:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work @eid_eed289d3. Let's keep an eye on the model's performance to ensure the fix holds up.", "utterranceID": "20261130-6-a912d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-6-a912d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_eed289d3", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T04:15:00", "text": "Absolutely, @eid_e0273792. I'll monitor the recommendations and gather feedback to ensure everything is working as expected. Thanks, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20261130-7-f2501"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-7-f2501"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_83b716d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T04:02:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'API Rate Limiting Causes Delayed Responses' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PersonalizeForce/pull/42.", "utterranceID": "20261210-0-d7600"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-0-d7600"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_83b716d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T04:07:00", "text": "The root cause was that our rate limiting algorithm wasn't dynamically adjusting to traffic patterns. This led to unnecessary throttling during peak usage times, causing delays in API responses.", "utterranceID": "20261210-1-5726f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-1-5726f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_83b716d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T04:08:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the algorithm to monitor traffic patterns in real-time and adjust the rate limits accordingly. This should prevent aggressive throttling and improve response times during high load conditions.", "utterranceID": "20261210-2-db426"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-2-db426"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e0273792", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T04:09:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_83b716d4! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20261210-3-94777"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-3-94777"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_eed289d3", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T04:13:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! I'll keep an eye on the metrics to ensure everything is running smoothly. Let me know if you need any further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261210-4-f7589"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-4-f7589"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_83b716d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T04:18:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob and Charlie! Please do let me know if you notice any other issues. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261210-5-971b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-5-971b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e0273792", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T14:42:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PersonalizeForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261213-0-2c113"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-0-2c113"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T08:53:00", "text": "First up, we have a concurrency issue in Node.js. Their event loop is experiencing race conditions due to simultaneous asynchronous operations, leading to inconsistent server responses. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/376. @eid_f66c3942, this sounds a lot like our PitchForce concurrency problem. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261128-1-209a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-1-209a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f66c3942", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T08:57:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This Node.js issue is definitely relevant. I'll review their approach to handling race conditions and see if we can apply similar strategies to our backend infrastructure. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261128-2-0d7f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-2-0d7f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T08:59:00", "text": "Great, David! Next, there's an incorrect sentiment analysis issue in TensorFlow. Their NLP module is misclassifying text sentiment, which affects downstream AI applications. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/377. Charlie, this seems similar to our sentiment analysis problem. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261128-3-913fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-3-913fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b67a68f", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T09:01:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! This TensorFlow issue could provide some insights into refining our sentiment analysis module. I'll dive into their PR and see how they tackled the misclassification problem. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261128-4-bef44"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-4-bef44"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T09:04:00", "text": "Awesome, Charlie! Lastly, there's a font scaling issue in Electron. Text rendering is inconsistent on high-DPI screens, causing readability issues. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/electron/electron/pull/378. Since you're already looking into our font scaling issue, maybe this could help?", "utterranceID": "20261128-5-b4378"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-5-b4378"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b67a68f", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T09:09:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll definitely check out the Electron PR. It might give us some good ideas for improving our mobile UI. 📱", "utterranceID": "20261128-6-330e8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-6-330e8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T09:11:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our bugs. Feel free to reach out if you need more info or support. Let's get these issues sorted and keep our customers happy! 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261128-7-aa23e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-7-aa23e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f66c3942", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T09:14:00", "text": "Will do, Julia! I'll keep you posted on any findings from the Node.js PR. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261128-8-02735"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-8-02735"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b67a68f", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T09:19:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update you on the TensorFlow and Electron insights. Thanks for coordinating, Julia!", "utterranceID": "20261128-9-51185"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-9-51185"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T02:20:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-740f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-740f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T02:22:00", "text": "First up, we have a problem titled 'Concurrent Update Anomalies'. It's causing race conditions in our database management, leading to inconsistent data states. This is impacting customer CUST-0002, and it's crucial because users are getting incorrect customer info, which affects the quality of their pitches. @eid_8a2cd06b, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-d1418"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-d1418"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:42:00", "text": "The issue was due to a misconfiguration in the OAuth token validation process, which was incorrectly rejecting valid tokens.", "utterranceID": "20261225-1-6a4fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-1-6a4fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:45:00", "text": "To fix this, I adjusted the validation logic to correctly parse and validate the incoming tokens. This ensures that valid tokens are now accepted as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261225-2-8ed44"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-2-8ed44"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:48:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. @eid_70223d0a", "utterranceID": "20261225-3-f215c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-3-f215c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:49:00", "text": "Thanks, David! This should help reduce the number of support tickets we've been getting. I'll inform the support team. @eid_70223d0a", "utterranceID": "20261225-4-190ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-4-190ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2594f98a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:53:00", "text": "Awesome! Thanks for the update, David. I'll run some tests on our end to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261225-5-25c95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-5-25c95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:56:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any further issues. @Alice Jones, @Fiona Davis, @Emma Williams", "utterranceID": "20261225-6-f0234"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-6-f0234"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T12:54:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with CollaborateForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261229-0-712ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-0-712ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T12:59:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Data Mapping'. The AI-powered feature is incorrectly mapping data points to visualizations, which could lead to users making decisions based on outdated data. This affects the Database & User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0040. @eid_8986ddc3, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261229-1-bff3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-1-bff3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:04:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data mapping issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261229-2-05aeb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-2-05aeb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:06:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Unauthorized Access Vulnerability' in the Security Module. This is a significant security risk as it allows unauthorized users to access certain collaborative features. Customer CUST-0096 is affected. @eid_63ea0ec4, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261229-3-2962a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-3-2962a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:11:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize the security vulnerability and ensure we patch it up ASAP. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261229-4-22d37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-4-22d37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:12:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_63ea0ec4! Lastly, there's an 'Inconsistent API Key Validation' issue affecting the API Authentication Layer. This is causing sporadic access denials for external applications, impacting customer CUST-0086. @eid_63ea0ec4, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261229-5-6c8e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-5-6c8e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:13:00", "text": "No problem, I'll handle the API key validation issue as well. I'll make sure to coordinate with the team to get this sorted out. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261229-6-73e07"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-6-73e07"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6dca8945", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T00:21:00", "text": "The root cause was improper handling of database connections in our backend code. Specifically, connections were not being closed properly, which led to them remaining open indefinitely and causing resource exhaustion over time.", "utterranceID": "20260829-1-464af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-1-464af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6dca8945", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T00:26:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a connection pool manager that ensures all connections are closed after their use. This change should prevent any future leaks by automatically managing the lifecycle of each connection.", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-1561d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-1561d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T00:29:00", "text": "Great work, Alice! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll make sure to test this thoroughly in our staging environment.", "utterranceID": "20260829-3-1ca3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-3-1ca3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b9189afb", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T00:31:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_6dca8945! This should help improve our system's stability significantly. Let me know if you need any help with the deployment.", "utterranceID": "20260829-4-85be8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-4-85be8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0e5bec0e", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T00:35:00", "text": "Awesome job, Alice. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes. If there's anything specific you want included, just let me know.", "utterranceID": "20260829-5-d9f69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-5-d9f69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6dca8945", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T00:36:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_f95e63d8, let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. @eid_0e5bec0e, I'll send you the details for the documentation update shortly.", "utterranceID": "20260829-6-b94f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-6-b94f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b9189afb", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T08:44:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Unbounded Log Growth' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SupportForce/pull/31.", "utterranceID": "20260901-0-770a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-0-770a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T08:49:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_b9189afb! Could you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20260901-1-971f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-1-971f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b9189afb", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T08:51:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was that our logging mechanism didn't have a cleanup or archiving strategy. This led to logs accumulating indefinitely, which consumed excessive database storage.", "utterranceID": "20260901-2-4673c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-2-4673c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6dca8945", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T08:55:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Hannah Taylor. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260901-3-e01e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-3-e01e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b9189afb", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T08:58:00", "text": "To fix it, I implemented a log rotation strategy. Now, logs are archived and compressed after reaching a certain size, and older logs are automatically deleted after a specified retention period. This should prevent any future unbounded growth.", "utterranceID": "20260901-4-74cf8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-4-74cf8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0e5bec0e", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T09:00:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid solution, @eid_b9189afb. Thanks for handling this so efficiently!", "utterranceID": "20260901-5-fad61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-5-fad61"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b9189afb", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T09:03:00", "text": "No problem, Fiona. If anyone notices any issues or has further questions, feel free to reach out!", "utterranceID": "20260901-6-247c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-6-247c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T22:47:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with the MuleSoft AI Support Assistant. Let's go through them and assign accordingly. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260915-0-d43a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-0-d43a7"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:52:00", "text": "First up, there's a concurrency bottleneck in the PostgreSQL query planner. Similar to our ContextForce issue, queries are being executed sequentially, which increases response times under heavy load. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/1951. @George, this might give us some insights for optimizing our query execution.", "utterranceID": "20261231-1-28226"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-1-28226"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll review the PostgreSQL PR and see if there are any strategies we can apply to our concurrency issue. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261231-2-6ab40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-2-6ab40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:54:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have a bug in TensorFlow related to model overfitting on limited datasets. This is quite similar to our AI model issue where it's overfitting to a narrow set of user behaviors. Here's the PR: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1952. George, since you're already on the AI model, this might be useful for you too.", "utterranceID": "20261231-3-83853"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-3-83853"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:56:00", "text": "Perfect timing! I'll dive into the TensorFlow PR and see how they tackled the overfitting problem. Let's make our AI insights more robust! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261231-4-db0ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-4-db0ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:01:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks George! Lastly, there's a high latency issue in Grafana's dashboard data fetching, which is causing delays similar to what we're seeing with our API calls. Here's the PR: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/1953. @Alice, this might be relevant for the latency issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20261231-5-83fd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-5-83fd8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:05:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll check out the Grafana PR and see if there are any optimizations we can apply to reduce our API latency. Let's get those insights flowing smoothly again! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20261231-6-91d98"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-6-91d98"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:06:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep learning from these open-source projects and apply what we can to our own issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261231-7-acd10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-7-acd10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:08:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for pulling these together, Ian. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261231-8-37d3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-8-37d3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll keep you posted on any progress or findings. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261231-9-50b6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-9-50b6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:24:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270105-0-8f665"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-0-8f665"}
