{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T02:07:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice. I'll update the ticket to reflect this information.", "utterranceID": "20270302-11-ce000"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-11-ce000"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:09:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Duplicate Data Entries' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/KnowledgeForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20270305-0-d51c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-0-d51c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_072d9c10", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:12:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_cdd331bc! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270305-1-5eaaf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-1-5eaaf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:15:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was a flaw in the deduplication logic within our data integration process. It wasn't correctly identifying and merging identical records, leading to multiple identical entries in the knowledge base.", "utterranceID": "20270305-2-c9f24"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-2-c9f24"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2471d598", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270305-3-a8ad5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-3-a8ad5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:23:00", "text": "I updated the deduplication algorithm to include a more comprehensive comparison of record attributes. This ensures that all relevant fields are checked before a new entry is created, effectively preventing duplicates.", "utterranceID": "20270305-4-138a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-4-138a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b95a6f0", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:24:00", "text": "Nice work, David! This should definitely help reduce confusion for our users.", "utterranceID": "20270305-5-4c849"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-5-4c849"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-caf201"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:29:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! If anyone notices any further issues, please let me know. Otherwise, we should be good to go.", "utterranceID": "20270305-6-b05b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-6-b05b9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_619c8be2", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:45:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Memory Leak in Data Visualization Module' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AnomalyForce/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20261021-0-928b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-0-928b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_619c8be2", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:49:00", "text": "The root cause was improper management of dynamic data objects. They weren't being released after use, which led to excessive memory consumption and eventually caused the application to slow down and crash.", "utterranceID": "20261021-1-b0872"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-1-b0872"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_619c8be2", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:51:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a cleanup routine that ensures all dynamic data objects are properly released once they're no longer needed. This should prevent the memory from being consumed unnecessarily.", "utterranceID": "20261021-2-00111"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-2-00111"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a88ee967", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:52:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_619c8be2! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll make sure to test it thoroughly.", "utterranceID": "20261021-3-ce7c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-3-ce7c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_737797e3", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:56:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah Johnson! This was a critical issue. I'll update the documentation to reflect the changes.", "utterranceID": "20261021-4-c6036"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-4-c6036"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionamiller-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-78bae9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1330d187", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:58:00", "text": "Awesome job, @eid_619c8be2! Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261021-5-768af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-5-768af"}
